# Not read by compose.yaml. HF_TOKEN is only needed as a GitHub Actions
# secret (used by scripts/sync_models.py during the GitOps sync) - the
# llama-server container serves pre-downloaded local GGUF files and never
# talks to HuggingFace itself, so no .env is actually required by the stack
# right now. Kept as a placeholder in case a future service needs one.
# Obtain from https://huggingface.co/settings/tokens
